  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I managed to join 100 groups already! A group manager (thanks, Joken and Skuld) messaged me saying that they could not accept my request, but were unsure why.\n\nAfter removing a few groups, I was able to join. However, there is a lack of context for the receiver of the invite. The error message should be more specific for them, so that they know what is going on.\n\nFor the sender end, there should be a category of groups called \"Pending requests\" available on the website, and the client, so that you can see all the groups that you currently sent invites to, so that you can remember to retract them if necessary.",
